<title>BULGARIA: WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JUNE 26 - WARM, RAIN.</title>
<headline>WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JUNE 26 - WARM, RAIN.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunny with cloudy spells across the country, rain expected later in the day in the east and in the mountains, state radio said.</p>
<p>Maximum temperatures are expected between 24 and 29 degrees, temperature in Sofia is seen at about 25 degrees. -- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
</text>
